notes.description:
Optional key-value store for any extra details about health that may be useful to an application user.

e.g. {"worst metric": "accuracy", "worst subject": "SKU-1234"}
e.g. {"explanation": "The model health is RED because the accuracy of 0.32 is below the threshold of 0.9!"}

versionEdits.description:
Tracks the version history of an object, which is only active if version history tracking is enabled. This field is
crucial for accessing previous versions of an object and is entirely managed by the system.

@see Ann.Db#versionHistory
